  dialogueLines:
  - 'Well, look who decided to come back at home '
  - You should really write more often, they have paper on boats, right?
  - Anyways, take a seat, tell me about you.
  - How have you been?
  - Where have you been?
  - Out in the world.
  - So far away from the old crows at home.
  - You are out there.
  - While you left us here.
  - YOU LEFT ME!
  - I had to do so much of the planning by myself.
  - Do you even know your dads favourite flowers?
  - He didnt have any, so you wouldnt have helped anyways.
  - You really are trying your best, huh?
  - Trying to live up to your name?
  - But not getting on the debate team, is simple inadequate.
  - You will never be a real Forughe with that lack of effort.
  - Well, i gave up that name too, when i met your dad
  - Who am i to judge.
  - Could you bring in the eggs, il get started on the kuku piaz
  - I know its your favourite.
